      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Framerate is not locked by VRChat but by the hardware drivers itself.\nIf you're using SteamVR it's caused by Reprojection and on Oculus it's caused by ASW.\nTurning these off is not recommended but it is possible to do so but this has nothing to do with VRChat itself so closing this.",
