  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I post this here without having confirmation apart from my friends that tell me the same.\n\nIt seems like VRChat sometimes caps itself at 45 fps when 90 fps cannot be reached. \n\nThis is very obvious in situations where it doesn't go up or down no matter what and only flickers between 45-46.\n\nI remember someone came up with the conclusion that this was done to prevent motion sickness. However I do not get that at all. \n\nSo my request is to allow the users to remove any framecap entirely or just set it for themself.",
